OL,3,AGrandfather dies months after
OL,4,Aconfronting burglars
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 85-year-old grandfather has died
OL,7,Fmore than four months after confronting
OL,8,Fburglars who broke into his home.
OL,10,FGordon Nicholass was the victim of a
OL,11,Fburglary at about 03:00 BST on 29 April
OL,12,Fat his home in the village of
OL,13,FHelmshore, Lancashire.
OL,15,FLancashire Police said he was assaulted
OL,16,Fand suffered injuries to his head and
OL,17,Fcuts to his face when he confronted the
OL,18,Fburglars. He was treated in hospital
OL,19,Fand sent home, but was later taken back
OL,20,Fto hospital and died on 12 August.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
