OL,3,AGrandfather dies months after
OL,4,Aconfronting burglars
OL,5,
OL,6,FPost-mortem tests have been carried
OL,7,Fout, but further inquiries are being
OL,8,Fmade to establish if the assault was a
OL,9,Fcause or contributory factor, police
OL,10,Fsaid. His family added: "Gordon was a
OL,11,Fwonderful husband, dad and granddad."
